# Hypertext and Compact Discs: The Challenge of Multi-Media Learning.

**Authors:** Megarry, Jacquetta

## Abstract
Describes hypertext as software that improves the learner's control over a knowledge base, and discusses the role hypertext could play in compact disc technologies. Digital multimedia learning materials are discussed; relationships among data, information, knowledge, and expertise are explored; and examples of applications of compact disc media are presented. (14 references) (LRW)

